    "displayName": "AbstentionBench",
    "aliases": ["Abstention Bench"],
    "description": "Holistic abstention benchmark spanning about 20 datasets and 6 scenarios (underspecified context, false premise, stale knowledge, unknown answers, underspecified intent, and related cases). An LLM judge labels whether the model abstained; headline metric is abstention recall (share of should-abstain items where the model abstains). Also reports precision, F1, and answer accuracy when abstention is not required.",
    "summary": "Measures whether the model declines to answer questions that lack enough information, rest on false ideas, or have no known answer.",
